    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mara",
        "speaker": "Mara",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 49,
        "text": "Is your appointment still on Thursday, Leo?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c607dea6c165e654830b02f1cb2490cd23683ba03d4b84b6df9d5ab055a2f198",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 55,
        "sourceEnd": 164,
        "text": "Yes, at two forty in the afternoon. I checked it this morning because I had written down two different times.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "55eb9d094002bfddf9ea64b268cf3da1da94542ced4fccdccc65a35a93328be3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "mara",
        "speaker": "Mara",
        "sourceStart": 171,
        "sourceEnd": 216,
        "text": "Where is the reception desk in that building?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8ff7a68d58076f232d975214f549ff31bb55f0e695fb37bbfb1b48fc13c3fc45",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 222,
        "sourceEnd": 344,
        "text": "It is beside the green entrance. The patient form is available there, and I can ask them to check the spelling of my name.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "50b1470923daa9768070746ff2f94025e3f28a4d95a148c903f9f4af96dbfdb6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "mara",
        "speaker": "Mara",
        "sourceStart": 351,
        "sourceEnd": 384,
        "text": "Have you prepared your questions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "969b84bec3fed24118d089a13549b60df20be28d98ba093396b73570d7c06d77",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 390,
        "sourceEnd": 548,
        "text": "I have a small list. I want to describe a cough, a sore throat and a headache. I will not guess a temperature or say I have a fever if I have not measured it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ff6e37e6b1fe01c09d037dcc7075b7d0defa29735ab53d2bdbe4a1e2ac1a581d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "mara",
        "speaker": "Mara",
        "sourceStart": 555,
        "sourceEnd": 605,
        "text": "Good. What about the pain you mentioned yesterday?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8158c393f8a02bc3b2e083cc9f35ddd40dba41ccfae6374b21dbd47f1a136e55",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 611,
        "sourceEnd": 782,
        "text": "I will describe where it is and when I first noticed it. I also wrote down a question about my stomach. The nurse can ask for any other information during the examination.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "098ca6e70d7a8b45bf97a12980e0bc712586c7bf2f6af657a812343143b1987e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "mara",
        "speaker": "Mara",
        "sourceStart": 789,
        "sourceEnd": 834,
        "text": "Is there a place to ask about a prescription?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "308c3c214db8283d28892b7d24cd2509fcab405a08eb53507744a774649fd959",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 840,
        "sourceEnd": 992,
        "text": "Yes. There is a pharmacy across the street. I have a question about a word on a medicine label, but I will ask the professional there rather than guess.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "cccdb064e7d53b50c91509289a22116f871fcd62f1a075c23d4b0cc61dd45c86",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "mara",
        "speaker": "Mara",
        "sourceStart": 999,
        "sourceEnd": 1016,
        "text": "Which word is it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0717ac2e704f8028b88e7ebf3bf79040b96057380be3fa7c0ccbce83c332408d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1022,
        "sourceEnd": 1140,
        "text": "Dose. I will show the tablet package and ask what the label means. I will not decide what to take from the word alone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b133a85a783259660c5d86d90c6542776e27baaaf4d0c0fcdde21c0edb8df5dc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "mara",
        "speaker": "Mara",
        "sourceStart": 1147,
        "sourceEnd": 1196,
        "text": "Did you write down your allergy question as well?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "00b6791798f558f834d7bb4d4dce76f2bd45aec96b1769f954b5d288357aa30c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1202,
        "sourceEnd": 1378,
        "text": "Yes. My main question is what information they need. I will ask the nurse how to describe how I breathe and when I might recover. I will also ask for advice about my treatment.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "67609bce52595d026c9e01583ecb26aaec471f65ee6b7f1f315855cc7b02cce0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "mara",
        "speaker": "Mara",
        "sourceStart": 1385,
        "sourceEnd": 1427,
        "text": "I can wait for you after my dentist visit.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "67d3ce5e851c0b5c97df08fbd2d060e184ad801267140b279e58b4a2f6520a82",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1433,
        "sourceEnd": 1556,
        "text": "Thanks. Please meet me by the yellow bench at three thirty, not at the green entrance. I will text you if the time changes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "606649e00bae41a853c1ca59feaba798ab8097f0976fa6fa796541eadda53eac",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
